(Subject: Exegesis of the Holy Quran) '
(Text: Tafseer Al-Jalalayn) '
() '
(SURAH AL-FATIHAH ANALYSIS:) '
(---------------------------) '
(1. Bismillah al-Rahman al-Rahim:) '
(   - In the name of Allah, the All-Merciful, the Especially Merciful.) '
(   - Grammatical note: Ba is Harf Jarr, Allah is Ism al-Jalal.) '
() '
(2. Al-Hamdu lillahi Rabb al-Alamin:) '
(   - Praise belongs to Allah, Sustainer of all creation.) '
(   - Al-Alamin: All existing realms \(mankind, jinn, angels, nature\).) '
() '
(3. Ar-Rahman ar-Rahim:) '
(   - Highlighting divine mercy in both worldly life and the Hereafter.) '
() '
(4. Maliki Yawm ad-Din:) '
(   - Master and Sovereign of the Day of Recompense.) '
() '
(Published by Muhyissunnah Dars Ukkuda Academic Board.) '
